				<r3d:description language="eng">A domain-specific repository for the Physical and Technical Sciences. This repository focuses on Dutch data providers that are not part of the netwok of Dutch technical universities (4TU), data providers that have a preference for Dataverse based repository services, and data providers that are already using the DANS Data Stations for other scientific domains (Life Sciences, Social Sciences and Humanities, Archaeology). The repository services are primarily aimed at the Netherlands, but not exclusively.</r3d:description>
